 "context": "<figure id=\"fig-ch44_01_01\" class=\" \"><span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp171730656\" data-alt=\"A flow chart of three boxes shows the hierarchy of living organisms. The top box is labeled “Organisms, populations, and communities” and has a photograph of tall trees in a forest. The second box is labeled “ecosystems” and has a photograph of a body of water, behind which is a stand of tall grasses developing into more dense vegetation and trees as distance from the water increases. The third box is labeled “the biosphere” and shows a drawing of planet Earth.\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20210823.155019/resources/3e8cda1dca94f1be444010d40b40375711e77ed4\" data-media-type=\"image/jpg\" alt=\"A flow chart of three boxes shows the hierarchy of living organisms. The top box is labeled “Organisms, populations, and communities” and has a photograph of tall trees in a forest. The second box is labeled “ecosystems” and has a photograph of a body of water, behind which is a stand of tall grasses developing into more dense vegetation and trees as distance from the water increases. The third box is labeled “the biosphere” and shows a drawing of planet Earth.\" width=\"300\" id=\"4\">\n</span>\n</figure>",
 "stimulus_html": "",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 242414,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/c7684e6163134c31.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Ali Swanson/Snapshot Serengeti)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n",
   "stem_html": "<p>The graph shows lion, cheetah and wild dog populations in the Serengeti, a geographical area in Africa. These predators often hunt the same prey and are in competition with each other.</p>\n<p>Lions kill cheetah cubs when they can find them. Make a claim about how this effects cheetah populations based on the graph.</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 759117,
     "content_html": "Killing the cheetah cubs caused cheetah population to go into a gradual decline."
    },
    {
     "id": 759116,
     "content_html": "Killing the cheetah cubs caused cheetah population to go into a steep decline."
    },
    {
     "id": 759115,
     "content_html": "Killing the cheetah cubs caused the cheetah to become locally extinct in the area."
    },
    {
     "id": 759118,
     "content_html": "Killing the cheetah cubs had no effect on the cheetah population."
    }
   ],
